  "reflectionText": "She rises while it is yet night and gives portions to her household. She works with willing hands. She opens her mouth with wisdom, and the teaching of kindness is on her tongue. Her children rise up and call her blessed. What is it to be the one whose ordinary, unwitnessed labor turns out to have been the thing that held the house up all along?",
